---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Swastik Industries" current="home">
<main>
<div class="hero"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/assets/f15.jpg" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/assets/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
<div class="wrap hero-in"><div class="eyebrow">Est. 2005 &middot; Delhi, India</div>
<h1>Building the infrastructure of today and tomorrow</h1>
<p>Cable trays, earthing material, steel structures and gratings. Fabricated, hot dip galvanised and tested in our own facility.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/products">Explore products</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#film">Watch the company film</a></div></div>
<div class="wrap"><div class="ticker"><span>11 kV</span><span>33 kV</span><span>66 kV</span><span>120 kV substation structures</span><span>Solar structures</span><span>Cable trays</span><span>Gratings</span></div></div></div>



<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">Product range</div><h2>Six families, one works</h2><p class="lede">Every product is customisable to the client's drawing and specification.</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<a class="card" href="/cable-trays"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f21.jpg" alt="Perforated cable tray bend" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Cable trays</h3><p>Perforated and ladder type, with bends, tees, reducers and crosses.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/raceway"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f30.jpg" alt="Raceway bracket detail" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Raceway and channels</h3><p>C channel, strut channel, C1 channel, cantilever arms and junction boxes.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/earthing-hardware"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f27.jpg" alt="Earthing strips and rods" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Earthing material</h3><p>GI plate, wire, strip, earth electrode and pipe, plus copper earthing.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/steel-structures"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f33.jpg" alt="Steel portal frame structure" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Steel structures</h3><p>Substation, transmission and solar structures from 11 kV to 120 kV.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/steel-structures"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f48.jpg" alt="Technician climbing a lattice tower" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Towers and walkways</h3><p>Electrical and telecom towers, solar structures and walkways.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/gratings"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f63.jpg" alt="Steel bar grating panel" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Gratings and stair treads</h3><p>Bearing bar gratings up to 2 m by 2 m, made to order.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a></div></div></section>



<section class="film" id="film"><div class="wrap film-grid"><div style="display:grid;gap:1rem"><div class="eyebrow">Company film</div><h2>Committed to building the infrastructure of today and tomorrow</h2><p>A 98 second look at the products we make and the projects they go into, from cable trays to telecom towers.</p></div>
<video controls preload="none" poster="/assets/f6.jpg"><source src="/assets/film.mp4" type="video/mp4">Your browser cannot play this video.</video></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">Where our products go</div><h2>Industries we supply</h2></div>
<div class="grid">
<a class="card" href="/industries"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f42.jpg" alt="Installer fitting solar structure" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Solar power plants</h3><p>Module mounting structures, walkways, cable trays and earthing.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/industries"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f36.jpg" alt="Steel frame structure" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Substations and transmission</h3><p>Structures for 11, 33, 66 and 120 kV substations and power lines.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a><a class="card" href="/industries"><div class="ph"><img src="/assets/f75.jpg" alt="Elevated metro viaduct at night" loading="lazy"></div><div class="tx"><h3>Metro and rail</h3><p>Steel work and support systems for elevated corridors.</p><span class="more">View range</span></div></a></div></div></section>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">Supplying to the best</div><h2>Trusted by developers and EPC contractors</h2></div>
<div class="clients"><span>Amplus</span><span>Jakson</span><span>Avenger Rays</span><span>Avendus</span></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Send your drawing or bill of quantities</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
